 "90 melee Attack Power to everyone sitting nearby, like Blessing of Might (at level 60, scaling with level)": "为附近所有坐下的人提供 90 点近战攻击强度，类似力量祝福（数值为 60 级时，随等级成长）",
 "A Camping contribution. Grants a buff equivalent to Power Word: Fortitude. Made from Linen Bandage and Refreshing Spring Water.": "营地贡献物。提供一个等同于「真言术：韧」的增益。由亚麻绷带和清凉的泉水制成。",
 "A Fish Bowl takes a Raw Brilliant Smallfish, which in Classic bites in the fresh water of the starting zones, and an Empty Vial from a vendor.": "鱼缸需要一条新鲜的光亮小鱼（经典旧世里在起始区域的淡水中可钓到）和一个从商人处购买的空瓶。",
 "A Fishing Rack or Fishing Hut goes over your Fish Bowl and keeps its 8% to all stats.": "钓具架或钓鱼小屋架设在鱼缸之上，保留其全属性 +8% 的效果。",
 "A camp buff does not stack with the class buff it copies, such as the Fish Bowl with Blessing of Kings: you keep one or the other.": "营地增益与它所模仿的职业增益不叠加，例如鱼缸与王者祝福：两者只能保有一个。",
 "A campfire for cooking, with room for 3 camp objects": "烹饪用营火，可放置 3 个营地物件",
 "A campfire with room for 10 camp objects": "可放置 10 个营地物件的营火",
 "A campfire with room for 5 camp objects": "可放置 5 个营地物件的营火",
 "A chance of stunning and doing heavy damage to demons.": "有几率击晕恶魔并造成大量伤害。",
 "A chance to grant Insight when you cast a spell, increasing Spirit by 100% for 10 sec.": "施放法术时有几率获得「洞悉」，使精神提高 100%，持续 10 秒。",
 "A chance to trigger Revelation when a non-periodic spell fails to critically strike. Revelation grants 100% increased critical strike chance to the next spell cast. Revelation's chance to trigger is diminished as your critical strike chance increases.": "非持续性法术未造成暴击时有几率触发「启示」，使下一次施放的法术暴击几率提高 100%。暴击几率越高，「启示」的触发几率越低。",
 "A cook crafts a Basic Campfire Kit from one Simple Wood, with Flint and Tinder in the bags, and places it. It burns for 15 minutes, and no other campfire can stand within 100 yards.": "厨师用一份普通木料制作初级营火工具包（背包中需有燧石与火绒），然后放置它。它持续燃烧 15 分钟，且 100 码范围内不能存在其他营火。",
 "A new Forever system. A cook builds a campfire, other players add objects from their professions, and anyone who sits by the fire for a minute gets their buffs for an hour. Each profession has three objects, the first at skill 20.": "无限服的全新系统。厨师搭建营火，其他玩家放入各自专业的物件，任何人在火边坐满一分钟即可获得一小时增益。每个专业有三个物件，第一个需要技能 20。",
